{"data": {"notes": [], "reqs": [{"kind": "contract", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R1", "source": {"type": "task_metadata"}, "status": "active", "text": "Entry point `solve` in language python, within the stated limits.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R2", "source": {"char_end": 218, "char_start": 0, "quote": "Input {\"nums\": integer list}. Return the next lexicographically greater permutation of nums; if nums is already the greatest permutation, return the smallest one (sorted ascending). The result is a permutation of nums.", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 260, "char_start": 230, "quote": "Input:\n{\"nums\": []}\nOutput:\n[]", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 316, "char_start": 272, "quote": "Input:\n{\"nums\": [1, 2, 3]}\nOutput:\n[1, 3, 2]", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R5", "source": {"char_end": 372, "char_start": 328, "quote": "Input:\n{\"nums\": [3, 2, 1]}\nOutput:\n[1, 2, 3]", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 3: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R6", "source": {"char_end": 428, "char_start": 384, "quote": "Input:\n{\"nums\": [1, 1, 5]}\nOutput:\n[1, 5, 1]", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 4: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1